{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — upon this they shall not stand." "<b>Morning cloud</b> — I have explained it: in the heat of the sun it shall not be found." "<b>Like chaff</b> — fine straw with a storm wind. It should have been יסוער with a dagesh [in the samekh]. And behold, it is a strange word grammatically."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {1 "Resolved the masculine pronoun suffix in פירשתיו as referring to the term משכים under discussion.", 2 "The referent of 'it should have been יסוער' is understood as the form יסער in the verse; Ibn Ezra notes it lacks the expected dagesh after the prefix."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:08.368469173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}